n><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体, SimHei; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 21px;">三、工作流程</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">一</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">志愿填报</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">大类专业分流填报志愿时间为6月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">23</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">09</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">:00～6月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">25</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日15:00。参与分流学生在一站式服务大厅</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（https://ehall.xidian.edu.cn）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">搜索“大类专业分流”模块，按照操作指南（见附件）进行操作。分流填报志愿为平行志愿，学生须按照意愿顺序填报大类内所有专业，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">填报时间内所填志愿可进行撤回与更改，志愿填报时间截止后，不予更改。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">若</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学生未在指定时间内提交志愿，系统</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">录取时</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">将</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">在学生所在大类剩余专业名额中</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">随机分配。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各专业以学生所在大类内的学业评价排名为依据，按照“位次优先、遵循志愿”的原则进行录取。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">成绩计算与公示</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">本次分流学生学业评价成绩包括课程成绩和综合素质测评成绩。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">课程成绩为大一学年必修课加权平均成绩及个别大类要求计算的专业核心课（《新生研讨</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">与</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学科导论</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">Ⅰ</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">》</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">《新生研讨</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">与</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学科导论</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">Ⅱ</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">》除外），总分 100 分。综合素质测评成绩评定由</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">新生</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">社区</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">具体开展，总分 10 分，详见《关于开展202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">级本科生大类专业分流学业评价综合素质测评工作的通知》。本次分流学生学业评价成绩包括课程成绩和综合素质测评成绩。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第二学期课程成绩录入完成后，对本人课程成绩有异议的，应于7月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">8</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日前提交相关纸质复核材料，逾期不予受理。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日～7月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">10</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">新生社区</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">对学生课程成绩核算排名，在大类专业分流模块中公示公布。补考或重修考试及格的成绩按“60分”计算；课程考核成绩不及格的（含补考、重修不及格），按最高考试成绩计算。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">录取结果公示</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学校按录取规则于7月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">13</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日完成专业预录取工作，并于7月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">14</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日～7月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">16</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日公示3天。学生可在大类专业分流模块中查看个人学业评价成绩、大类位次及录取结果。公示期内如有</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">异议</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，学生应以书面形式通过</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">新生社区</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">进行反映。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">四</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">分流学生学籍异动</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">公示期满后，学校将下发文件。各学院按文件于7月1</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日进行学生学籍异动。学籍异动应及时、准确，以便学生正常开展后续选课工作。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 42.6667px; min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; font-size: 21px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体, SimHei; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 21px;">四、其他事项</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各学院</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">可根据学院情况于</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6月11日前</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">自行</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">开展专业宣传和咨询工作，学生在志愿填报期间需要对志愿专业咨询的，也可及时与开设单位联系，具体如下：</span></p><table class="docx_4" style="width: 376.25pt; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 191.05pt;"><col style="width: 89.05pt;"><col style="width: 96.15pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height: 22.9pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">单位</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">名称</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">负责教师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">办公电话</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.2pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通信工程学院</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">顾</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">老师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">81891677</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 23.05pt